	(descr "Zetta ZDSD64GLQEAG-R SD NAND, LGA 9.00 x 10.00 mm (E x D), 16 lands for 8 signals. Source: sdnand_zetta_family_atta.pdf p.15 'Package Dimensions' bottom view: lands L x b = 0.80 x 0.60 mm (outer columns) and 0.80 x 0.80 mm (inner columns, b1), row pitch 1.27 mm, inner columns 1.1 to 1.9 mm from the package ends, outer columns 0 to 0.8 mm. Each signal has one outer and one inner land (same pad number). Signals p.4 section 5 (left group of the bottom view, top to bottom): 1 DAT2, 2 CD/DAT3, 3 CLK, 4 GND; right group: 5 VDD, 6 DAT1, 7 DAT0, 8 CMD. The maker numbers no land: pin numbers 1 to 8 are ours (open-pins.csv), in the order of the maker's figure. This footprint is the top view (bottom view mirrored); pin 1 marker at the top right. Package long axis along x.")
